<title>FINLAND: YIT SEES FIM 66 MLN GAIN ON VALTATIE SALE.</title>
<headline>YIT SEES FIM 66 MLN GAIN ON VALTATIE SALE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction group YIT-Yhtyma Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it would book an extraordinary gain of 66 million markka from the sale of its Valtatie unit to Superfos and Colas Danmark .  </p>
<p>&quot;Due to the sale published today a sales profit of about 66 million markka will be booked,&quot; YIT said in a statement.</p>
<p>YIT has earlier estimated the 1997 earnings to exceed 1996 when profit before extraordinary items and tax was 169 million markka, up from 13 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
